  m_Name: CraftYourFirstEye
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Quest
  title: Forging a Demon Eye
  description: 'You need to learn how to create Demon Eyes and shove them into your
    eye socket.

    It will give your attacks all sorts of upgrades depending on
    the combination of eye upgrades you forge with.

    Bring a handful of eye upgrades
    back to the hideout along with a regular ole eye and use the forge to create
    a demon eye.'
